From: Ted Meyer <tmathmeyer@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 17:45:43 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] [Backport] Dependency for CVE-2026-118327

Manual backport of patch originally reviewed on
https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8342157:
Remove HlsDataSourceProvider::ReadStatus

Its pointless, and made errors harder to read.

